{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1000_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e7a4335f4d67d87acd85d52615faa99588a68f068871d0653eb21e56e03a0a95", "ja": "こ、これは……。\nいえ……たまには、こういうのも……？", "zh": "这、这是……\n不……偶尔这样也……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3e3b0f5ab49bf36853d55626b325fb2c461a099097320d47884b42dedd353c6c", "ja": "紬、お疲れさま。随分熱心なんだな。", "zh": "紬，辛苦了。真是相当认真啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4f785ad06e7c09d009ec3501ff9e9b9f4b045ed5142818b755e6ff6f90be3844", "ja": "ひゃ……っ！？　{$P$}！\nいつからそこに！？", "zh": "呀……！？{$P$}！\n你什么时候来的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c0452d5252ed936b174e686de6445ceea1248cc50405019c59e0f1d761bfbede", "ja": "今来たばかりだよ。\nそれより、衣装に何か問題でもあったのか？", "zh": "我才刚到。\n话说回来，服装是出了什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0b30a97e8ec8369a538fb398e1895dcd824a37bb4894f66f94e2689e86e846c7", "ja": "い、いえ。そうではありません。\n問題があるのは、そちらではなく……。", "zh": "不、不是的。没有那回事。\n有问题的并不是衣服，而是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4ec222c8e399989e255deefc2bedd33b94ea342b583b92013295021c9c556118", "ja": "いえ、その……とても素敵なお衣装だと思うのですが。\n私には、可愛すぎませんか？", "zh": "不，那个……我觉得这身服装非常漂亮。\n但对我来说，是不是太可爱了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7fd7687495d175d3ddb6784e91c2142b043ca8a341f7c30e8b23e2a047368f09", "ja": "ああ……いや、そんな事ないよ。\nよく似合ってるぞ！", "zh": "啊……不，没那回事。\n很适合你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "de36fb0bf6922aec63c6248df8119b28cb8465785a06971c840bfb2621cb111b", "ja": "そ、そんな……貴方に言われても、信用できません。\nひいき目に見ているのでは？", "zh": "哪、哪有……就算是您这么说，我也没法相信。\n您是不是戴着偏见在看呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3c5bd7e3e41eff1c60ff85ad1f99970675de456fe66e5a96e852cd90fad5879c", "ja": "ブログのコメントは、まだ見てないのか？\nファンのみんなも、すごく褒めてくれてるよ。", "zh": "你还没看博客上的评论吗？\n粉丝们也都夸得特别厉害呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1009_p", "source_sha256": "24d77c6ea1b9f685bb5d66580e5a631818e7d69c66125a335f868cef0205a4b6", "ja": "「普段と違う魅力！」とか「素直にかわいい！」とか、\nあとは、「結婚して！」とか……。", "zh": "像是“和平时不同的魅力！”、“很单纯地觉得可爱！”，\n还有“请和我结婚！”之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0476c4b00a0bd7ada721cf6c290865233744039c26cf04ab769c51d13f97960c", "ja": "っ！　そ、そうですか。結婚はまだ早いかと……。\nいえ、アイドルですから、そもそも無理ですが。", "zh": "！这、这样啊。结婚什么的还早了点吧……\n不，毕竟我是偶像，本来就是不可能的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "da7a768501d3ff491a03a83e56c8e5058022d781a7893a8b54e09f4738a3148e", "ja": "……。\nまあ、正直なところ、安心しました。", "zh": "……\n不过，说实话，我放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1012_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6e2e3c893423b087471355353178d8e4baaf810818a426631203a92cb15343dc", "ja": "私にこのお衣装のような、まっすぐな可愛らしさが\n果たしてあるのか、と……思ってしまって。", "zh": "我不禁想到……我身上究竟有没有像这套服装一样，纯粹直白的可爱呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7bd6fbd6d3d593ebd0d6e1ac6f3a9c20fd531d9cdbccb1cbf154353924875623", "ja": "そこは自信を持ってくれ！\nファンのみんなも、期待してくれてるんだから。", "zh": "要对自己有信心啊！\n粉丝们也都在期待着呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "812464dce704a964438016889b120fd24c9ee3e27b33edc5620f356e12add07a", "ja": "そうは言いますが……初めて袖を通すお衣装ですから。\n不安になるのも、当然でしょう。", "zh": "您虽然这么说……可这毕竟是我第一次穿上这套服装。会感到不安，也是理所当然的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d5787f564179db3ce67b0911773b7b924802f276af2a9fa5a21937c54674cabe", "ja": "もっと、このお衣装に相応しい\n可愛らしい振る舞いを、身につけなくては……。", "zh": "我必须掌握更多\n配得上这身演出服装的可爱举止才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1016_p", "source_sha256": "54b83d58f63e662c89839a95032ef6466a26976e7f519f70f0e742b5a4b113ff", "ja": "うーん。そこは普段通りで、\nじゅうぶん、いいと思うんだけどな。", "zh": "嗯——我觉得平时那样就已经很好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "34f0b74a26328ebd5eaac303684b3af9419752d9e1d073eec67af6329da6f703", "ja": "普段通りで……。\nあの、それは……努力をしても無駄だ、と？", "zh": "按平时那样……。\n那个，这是说……努力了也没用，是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1018_p", "source_sha256": "75d30e94610268d5ed16e45656407dbaf5a8d98ad1af20c9c7693ee9318053d6", "ja": "い、いやいや、そうじゃなくて……。\nん？　いや、そうかも。", "zh": "不、不是不是，才不是那样……  \n嗯？不，也许真是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1020_p", "source_sha256": "995c2c6272451ccf7c9b3309734606fc49e7c1a08202232b386bc71d09c0bf8a", "ja": "可愛らしい振る舞いなら、紬はもうできてると思うよ。\nだから、身につける必要はないってこと。", "zh": "要说可爱的举止，我觉得紬你已经做得很好了。\n所以，没必要再去刻意学习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1021_p", "source_sha256": "966e94eaf0079c3844a60c2e5e4a8e89b8cccd42f73152049ff8519283d99d6a", "ja": "無理はしないで、今のままでいい。\nその方が自然だから。", "zh": "别勉强自己，保持现在这样就好。\n因为那样才自然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "eeeeb9d15e212ff41eecba475d5240fb8ac54cdb6b7833bfb5a0c2ee81f30bed", "ja": "……。仰ることは、わかりました。\nですが……少しくらいは、無理をさせてください。", "zh": "……。您说的这些，我明白了。\n但是……至少稍微，也让我勉强一下自己吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0184_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0184_1023_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ac4317b128de1bc2091ae0cd0ba45ba89eab54511272767994e3abc9b2973a07", "ja": "せっかく……。\nあなたから頂いた、お衣装なのですから。ふふっ。", "zh": "难得……这是您送给我的服装嘛。呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
